    "RTR40": "7th Royal Tank Regiment association history, 1940–1941: regiment and Matilda tanks sailed 21 August 1940 and reached Port Said 24 September. The game's Alexandria entry is a map-scale proxy, not its actual port of arrival. https://4and7royaltankregiment.com/1940-1941/",
    "MED40": "British official history, The Mediterranean and Middle East, vol. I, chapter XI: 4th Blackshirt and 64th Catanzaro divisions were in reserve near Tobruk before the September advance; the 7th Armoured Division Support Group observed the Sollum–Fort Maddalena frontier line from 13 August. Exact 10 km hexes are game estimates. https://www.ibiblio.org/hyperwar/UN/UK/UK-Med-I/UK-Med-I-11.html"
  },
