  "about": "Opening campaign research trial before the historical 13 September Italian advance. The December Compass roster is back-projected here to preserve unit identities across the campaign; September unit-level placements, strengths, stocks and camps are estimates, not a validated 1 September order of battle. The 4th Blackshirt and 64th Catanzaro divisions start as reserves near Tobruk; the 7th RTR is withheld until its documented 24 September arrival in Egypt. Italian troops begin west of the frontier and the Commonwealth retains Egypt. No historical advance is forced.",
